# SHAPE-GATE.allow — this leg's exemptions from the shape gate (bench/tools/shapegate).
# The format, the rules and the shared tooling's entries: bench/SHAPE-GATE.allow.
# Paths are repository-relative.

names bench/tables/go/shape.go 2 original shape adapter: generated root type and load callback only, no fields
names bench/tables/go/shape_matched.go 4 paired shape adapter: the canonical packet root type at its bench_table call site and the FIXED form's root at its own (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §3.4), each with its load callback and no fields (callsite)
